# Third seat is looser: a good five-card suit will do.
vul     None
N KQT96.32.54.J432      | P P     | 2S     | third seat: a good five-card suit
N J8764.32.54.KJ32      | P P     | P      | third seat: a poor five-card suit is still a pass

# Fourth seat has no weak two: 2S is a sound opening.
